      'An Irvine traumatic brain injury claim can take time to understand, because changes in memory, mood, school, or work may appear gradually, and settling early can leave future care out. Kyle Scott has practiced law since 1991 and has run his own firm since 2003. If you are looking for a brain injury attorney in Irvine, your first conversation is with him.',
