      'Kyle Scott has practiced law since 1991 and has run his own firm since 2003. He reviews how the crash happened, which drivers and policies are involved, including the rider’s own motorcycle policy, and how the injuries affect work and daily life. The firm handles insurance negotiations, uninsured and underinsured motorist claims, lawsuits, mediation, and trial. If you are looking for a motorcycle accident attorney in Tustin, your first conversation is with Kyle Scott himself.',
